AI (Artificial Intelligence)

AI is the broad field of creating machines that can perform tasks that normally require human intelligence such as reasoning, learning, decision-making, and problem-solving.

Examples
Voice Assistants (Siri, Alexa)
ChatGPT
Self-driving cars


Machine Learning (ML)

Machine Learning is a subset of AI where computers learn patterns from data and make predictions without being explicitly programmed.

Examples
Email Spam Detection
Netflix Recommendations
House Price Prediction


Deep Learning (DL)

Deep Learning is a subset of Machine Learning that uses neural networks with multiple layers to automatically learn complex patterns from large amounts of data.

Examples
Face Recognition
Image Classification
Speech Recognition



